Subject: [PATCH] xpon: publish Q1000K GEM bindings after verified commands

Serialize GEM/T-CONT control, snapshot data mappings under one state lock and
retain retiring bindings until physical FIFO retirement is available. Reject
raw table writes, live rebinding and unintegrated encryption/recovery paths.

---
